# Software factory: the hidden security lane and scratch space.
# .security/ holds unremediated findings and their ordered remediation index
# (.agents/factory/methodology.md). A public roadmap of live vulnerabilities in a
# multi-user command-execution service is an attacker's work plan; the fixes ship
# publicly, the standing inventory does not. Never commit anything under it.
